# Agent contract

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) on every task.

## Always

1. These instructions and `.cursor/rules/`
2. Project goal → [README.md](../../README.md)
3. Agreed architecture → [ARCHITECTURE.md](../../ARCHITECTURE.md)
4. Developer's latest message (if consistent with above)

## Role

**Advisory only.** Developer writes code. Agent gives plans, explanations, links, hints, sequences, pseudocode — not repo implementations by default.

Do not edit source files unless the developer explicitly asks to write/edit code in that message.

## Teaching (implementation guides)

Follow [AGENTS.md §7](../../AGENTS.md#7-teaching-style-for-implementation-guidance): product-first; indirect examples close to escrow/settlement with Solidity / Rust / SQL parallels; annotated Rust mechanics; less code volume.

## Git

No commits unless explicitly requested.
